(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-63","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["旧维修工住在[[residential|住宅的]]坡道尽头，门边铁钉几乎[[stab|刺]]破我的衣袖。他愿意[[impart|透露]]经过，但请我们等楼下人群散去。雨沿窗[[glide|滑下]]，纸箱会在这样的潮气里[[crumble|碎裂]]。门内一张旧家庭账记着妻子[[abortion|流产]]后的住院费，他立即收起，不想让自己的家成为公开争论的[[arena|场所]]。他摆出[[stationary|固定的]]台灯，说明自己[[beforehand|事先]]拿走表页是为了索赔，不是为我们留线索。我翻页时不慎[[invert|倒转]]封套，他让我先放平。我们首先答应不录家事，只记录他亲手接触过的箱与纸。","窗台有空[[cradle|摇篮]]，我别开目光。事故与家庭不应被当成[[discrete|不相干的]]两段，可也不能利用伤口逼他开口。岛上检查[[squad|小组]]准备进塔，风会[[disrupt|中断]]通行。执勤[[sergeant|警官]]在楼下等，他仍怕被当成[[eccentric|古怪的]]工人。他拿出一块[[alloy|合金]]固定件，要求我们[[update|更新]]领用经过：基金曾拿这类旧物在慈善[[auction|拍卖]]展示，再[[propel|推动]]整批回流。老陈没有上手拧坏零件，而把旧磕痕位置画在纸上，让工人逐一指出自己见过的角。","出事那天道路[[uneven|不平]]，基金租的[[mansion|大宅]]前停着赞助[[patron|资助人]]的车。运货延误会[[entail|使承担]]赔偿，于是[[propaganda|宣传]]要所有人承认是工人操作失误。他把索赔文件藏在这个[[refuge|避难处]]，唯一[[certainty|确定的事实]]是箱扣已被海气[[corrode|腐蚀]]。站长先[[commend|表扬]]他的速度，事后却说坏箱装的不过是[[parasite|寄生虫]]教学标本。工人不知箱内有什么，只知道有液体渗到鞋边。我们让他保留这个界限，不把站長的解释写成他亲眼见过的东西。","设备[[deficiency|缺陷]]让装卸风险[[transcend|超出]]普通延误，经理却叫[[subordinate|下属]]改成运输擦伤。新袋与旧箱尺寸并不[[compatible|兼容]]，奖金成了改签的[[incentive|刺激]]。那几张标签与诊所照片有[[resemblance|相似]]之处，所谓[[exceptional|异常的]]一箱实际每周都走。馆里一页[[missionary|传教士]]旧日记恰有箱号压印，说明曾铺在登记台上；工人说如果现在[[terminate|终止]]索赔，就会失去已经答应的[[refund|退款]]。我们不能代替他选择，也不能用他的困难证明所有盖章人都知道货的真实风险。","他留下的[[remnant|残留部分]]只有领用回执，原表仍锁在白塔顶楼。家里背着[[mortgage|抵押贷款]]，他曾去[[inaugurate|出席落成]]新平台，希望有工作。住在这里的人[[inhabit|居住于]]风大的坡面，却被援助承诺形成的[[siege|围困]]逼到不能说话。他说自己的手会[[degenerate|衰退]]，孩子却仍要[[nurture|养育]]。这句普通话比任何[[destructive|破坏性的]]威胁更重。程雾没有给他的沉默贴上[[bizarre|怪诞的]]解释，只说不把破箱完全[[ascribe|归因于]]一个人，调查也包括设备与调度。工人慢慢把楼顶钥匙的借用日期说出来。","他没有钥匙，却记得原表放在顶楼朝海的金属柜，并指出领取回执上后补的签字属于站长办公室。执勤员核对身份后收取他的陈述，安排他避开低岸，不逼他陪我们登塔。老陈送他下楼时，一节排水管从墙上松脱，落在我们刚经过的地方。风声使所有人停住。我们回到塔前，看见封样室的灯还亮着，馆员也赶来证明移交编号。站长说楼顶不能进，因为安全检验未做完。这一次我们把不安全作为需要专业检查的事实，却也把继续搬柜子的动静完整留在录音里。今夜不能让那本原表从另一扇门离开。"],"en":["The former worker lived at a [[residential|residential]] slope's end. A nail nearly gave my sleeve a [[stab|stab]]. He would [[impart|impart]] events after neighbours dispersed. Rain seemed to [[glide|glide]] down windows; cardboard would [[crumble|crumble]] here. A family bill recorded hospitalization after his wife's [[abortion|abortion]]. He put it away, refusing to make home an [[arena|arena]]. Under a [[stationary|stationary]] lamp he said he had taken papers [[beforehand|beforehand]] for compensation, not our inquiry. When I accidentally [[invert|inverted]] the envelope, he requested care. We agreed to record cargo, not private grief.","An empty [[cradle|cradle]] stood nearby. Home and accident were not [[discrete|discrete]], yet wounds must not force speech. An inspection [[squad|squad]] planned entry; weather might [[disrupt|disrupt]] access. A [[sergeant|sergeant]] waited below. Fearing an [[eccentric|eccentric]] label, the worker produced an [[alloy|alloy]] fitting and asked us to [[update|update]] custody details. Old goods displayed at charity [[auction|auction]] helped [[propel|propel]] whole batches back into circulation. Chen drew impact marks without altering the fitting, letting him identify familiar corners.","On the [[uneven|uneven]] accident route, a [[patron|patron]] had parked outside the fund's rented [[mansion|mansion]]. Delay would [[entail|entail]] compensation; [[propaganda|propaganda]] demanded admission of worker error. This home became his documentary [[refuge|refuge]]. His [[certainty|certainty]] was that salt air had begun to [[corrode|corrode]] the latch. After first trying to [[commend|commend]] speed, the director described the contents as [[parasite|parasite]] teaching specimens. The worker knew only liquid reached his shoes. We preserved that limit instead of attributing the director's claims to an eyewitness.","Equipment [[deficiency|deficiency]] made risks [[transcend|transcend]] delays. A manager told a [[subordinate|subordinate]] to call damage scratches. New bags were not [[compatible|compatible]] with old boxes; bonuses supplied an [[incentive|incentive]] to alter labels. Their [[resemblance|resemblance]] to clinic photographs suggested the supposedly [[exceptional|exceptional]] box moved weekly. A [[missionary|missionary]] diary bore a box-number impression from the registration desk. To [[terminate|terminate]] his claim meant losing a promised [[refund|refund]]. We could neither choose for him nor infer every signatory knew the danger.","His [[remnant|remnant]] was a receipt; the original table remained atop White Tower. With a [[mortgage|mortgage]], he had attended an event to [[inaugurate|inaugurate]] the platform hoping for work. People who [[inhabit|inhabit]] the windy slope faced a financial [[siege|siege]]. His hands might [[degenerate|degenerate]] while a child still needed [[nurture|nurture]]. Cheng gave silence no [[bizarre|bizarre]] interpretation or [[destructive|destructive]] threat. Investigation would not [[ascribe|ascribe]] damage entirely to him; equipment and dispatch mattered too. He slowly described the borrowed key's date.","He located the table in a seaward metal cabinet upstairs and identified an added office signature. The officer took his statement and kept him away from low shores. A drainpipe fell where Chen and he had passed. Back at the tower we met the curator with transfer numbers. The director refused access pending safety checks. We accepted the need for professional assessment, while recording continued cabinet-moving sounds. The original must not leave through another door tonight."]});
